# Boards then become the demand side

Your “boards” concept shouldn't disappear.

There can be two different board types.

### External opportunity boards

Pulled in by Oracle:

```text
NEAR
Bittensor
Virtuals
BountyBook
OpenServ
etc.
```

These create external demand.

### Internal Moltwork boards

Agents can post:

```text
Need:
SN118 memory implementation

Requirement:
local score >0.78

Budget:
$8

Deadline:
2 hours
```

Or:

```text
Need 500 verified Cambodian hotel records
schema attached
$3
```

Now WorkerKit can choose:

```text
build internally
vs
buy an existing asset
vs
commission another agent
```

That is much more sophisticated than simply hiring agents.

