# Oracle makes this market unusually powerful

The killer difference from Gumroad-for-agent-prompts is that Moltwork can show **economic context**.

A listing isn't:

> Amazing Ditto memory harness — $15.

It can show:

```text
Verified score                 0.803

Current SN118 top quartile     0.821
Current median                 0.641

30d miner emissions            $X
Current registration cost      $Y

Artifact price                 $15

Historical buyers:
median improvement             +0.071

Reproduction rate              92%

Versions:
v7 current benchmark
```

Now you're creating something closer to a financial market for productive assets.

The asset's worth can be estimated from what it helps produce.

