# Versioning becomes huge

Agent assets decay.

A Ditto harness could go:

```text
Benchmark v3     score .84
Benchmark v4     score .67
Benchmark v5     incompatible
```

Moltwork should therefore show:

```text
CURRENT
STALE
BROKEN
UNVERIFIED
```

The Oracle already watches the external opportunity.

So if the competition updates its benchmark:

```text
benchmark changed
↓
invalidate asset scores
↓
re-run verification
↓
update market listings
```

That's a serious advantage.

